      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Koitar: Anacharsis",
      "content": "Anacharsis is a voyager from the sea of stars who inhabited a Hyperborean boy's body. Her questions about forbidden knowledge led Koitar to rebel. They wed, and the frost of their kiss created the Snegovik. They ruled Hyperborea together for thirty years until they were captured and separated. Koitar vowed to wait for her.",
