      "key": [
        "Boreas",
        "Andrius",
        "Wolf of the North"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Koitar",
        "Amsvartnir",
        "Seelie"
      ],
      "comment": "Koitar: Boreas and Koitar",
      "content": "The wolf who came to Koitar in the Royal Court seemed to her a foolish servant until he bore her mockery without resentment. She named him Boreas, \"North Wind\". Through her blessing he gained speech and calls her mother. He left with his kin for the south, promising to make its people prosperous, and through him she regained memory of Anacharsis.",
