        "Naberius",
        "Vila"
      ],
      "comment": "Koitar: Stolen authority of Life",
      "content": "Koitar took a portion of Naberius's authority of Life and gave it to Hyperborea's artisans, who forged fae spirits on the bones of giant beasts. It passed through many hands and was ultimately entrusted to the Vila, according to Anastasya in the 7.1 Archon Quest.",
