      "comment": "Koitar: The Angels' Crown",
      "content": "Angels wore elemental crowns that also bound them to the Heavenly Principles' service. Koitar's broke when she learned Anacharsis's true origin. She urged her fellow angels to rebel and warned them they would be cursed into Seelie.",
